Built With macOs 15.6 On Late 2013 Mac Pro With OCLP

1) IAX Client: ./iaxclient-code
requires portaudio
pa_stable_v190700_20210406.tgz

requires speex, speexdsp
/usr/lib64/libspeex.so.1.5.2

requires gsm
Obtained From: https://www.quut.com/gsm/gsm-1.0.22.tar.gz
Checkout into this directory from: git@github.com:TalkVideo/libgsm-1.0.22.git
And run `make` in that directory.

requires vidcap -- may be disabled
libvidcap-0.2.1
/usr/local/lib/libvidcap.so.1.0.0

Configure With:
./configure --prefix=$HOME/TalkFone --enable-local-gsm --enable-static --enable-clients=testcall CFLAGS=-mmacosx-version-min=15

Additional clients iaxphone iaxcomm stresstest, etc require additional deps.
--enable-local-gsm Uses Headers in ./iaxclient-code/lib/gsm/

Edit These Files For Header And Library Locations:
kiax2core/gui.pro 
kiax2core/kiax2core.pro 

Then run:
qmake6
from top-level of kiax-code directory

